        "t": "text",
        "v": "A sales order for more pairs than exist creates the shortfall the rest of the chain answers. Planning will see it only if its delivery date falls inside the item's order horizon, which LN computes in workdays on a calendar, and the order is approved now because phase 6's release needs it, not because planning does."
      }
